      <PointList items={ONE_SITE} />
      <h3 class="sub-h">Doesn't fit</h3>
      <p class="prose" set:html={`<b>Gist answers as FORA offers.</b> Gist sells agents nothing: its terms forbid access by any "agent or other automatic device" (${a(P.terms, 'Terms of Use')}). A Gist answer is also written when someone asks, and FORA sells resources that exist before the sale (${a('/getting-started/what-is-fora/#scope', 'What is FORA?')}). ProRata offers no payment service to others either, so an Exchange can't settle through it.`} />
    </Fragment>
