      alt="Your CDN's bot product runs first and the FORA edge function second: ProRata's crawler gets through if you allow it at your CDN, because it is not on the edge's bot list; an AI agent with a signed link passes after the edge checks the link; and an AI bot without a signed link is refused at the edge."
